    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Scalar value type for a <ref refid="classRangeMap" kindref="compound">RangeMap</ref>. Values can be merged if they compare equal; splitting a value is done by copying it. The <ref refid="classRangeMapValue_1a1091d77810a4def6cc41f71a90c3e602" kindref="member">removing()</ref> and <ref refid="classRangeMapValue_1a52ceef3fdd85e481c1cdec934880fa87" kindref="member">truncate()</ref> methods are no-ops. This class is often used as a base class for other more sophisticated range maps. See the <ref refid="classRangeMapVoid" kindref="compound">RangeMapVoid</ref> class for full documentation. </para>    </detaileddescription>
